{% comment %}
  `bind:` spreads the block's fields into the component, so its params trace back
  to frontmatter rather than being literals in the tag. That's what makes the
  original editable in the Visual Editor, not just the locale values RCC owns.

  Each block carries its own `_uuid`, which the component uses for data-rosey-ns.
  Without it Bookshop falls back to the array index, and keys shift on reorder.
{% endcomment %}
{% for block in content_blocks %}
  {% bookshop "{{block._bookshop_name}}" bind: block %}
{% endfor %}
